  "sangamTamil": "பல்லா ரறியப் பறையறைந்து நாள்கேட்டுக்\nகல்யாணம் செய்து கடிபுக்க - மெல்லியல்\nகாதல் மனையாளும் இல்லாளா என்ஒருவன்\nஏதில் மனையாளை நோக்கு.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Why should a man who has his own wife look at his neighbour's ? While his loving wife dwells in his home, the tender one whom he espoused, — seeking (out an auspicious) day, and sounding the drum, for many folks to know,—and 'whom he guards as his own, what means a man's glance at another's wife?",
